                    Presidential Materials, NSC Files, Box 51,
                    Presidential Daily Briefings. Eyes Only For the President.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d178-f2" n="2" xml:id="d178-f2-content">
                <p>A reference to Yamani’s meetings with
                    administration officials. See <ref target="#d176">Document 176</ref>. He also
                    gave an interview to <hi rendition="#italic">The Washington Post</hi> on April
                    18, which was reported the next day; see “Saudis Tie Oil to U.S. Policy on Israel, <hi rendition="#italic">The
                        Washington Post</hi>, April 19, 1973, p. A1.</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
